    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i don't want to \"recreate\" purpose? what if i'm just tired of fighting to belong? it feels so exhausting to keep pretending there's a point to it all. sometimes it feels more like a mercy to just let the tide take you instead of struggling against it.",
